    {
     "title": "OTHER CHANGES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added enemies to the bridge in Coast",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A MESSAGE FROM THE DEV TEAM",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, we want to thank all of you for checking FEROCIOUS out. It's an honor to have you playing our game after all those years of creating it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We acknowledge all the issues the community has reported to us one hundred percent. Our team is working at a high pace to resolve them, so expect more patches in the coming days. Please don't hesitate to share your valuable feedback here; let us know if you run into bugs on this subforum.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
